  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for El Salvador - Government Debt Issuance and Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide TA to CEPA on best practices in the areas of operations, administration and project execution. OTA work will focus assistance on improving profitability of its operating units, insuring safety and maximizing the use of CEPAs strategic assets. Of key interest for CEPA is the international airport, for which there are detailed tasks relating to preparing the airport to implement the Master Plan, enhancing profitability, establishing activity based costing and key performance metrics, strengthening risk management and contract compliance management, building a project management team, and, as needed, creating a PPP contract compliance function within CEPA, as well as planning a program office and making sound business decisions on the best way to implement and finance the Master Plan expansion project. Other areas of TA focus include the revitalization of the FENADESAL rail operations; and the better use of underutilized CEPA facilities at La Union, and other places as needed. Other areas of TA are the development of institutional and staff capacity to direct and manage the national PPP program, as well as advise Ministry of Hacienda PPP staff on key knowledge,</narrative>
  </description>
